    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCity living at its best - this is a wonderful light filled two bedroom, first floor apartment, ideally located in the ever-popular Gasworks development. It is superbly located with shops, bars, restaurants and the DART on the doorstep, in the heart of Dublin 4, just a short walk from Ballsbridge and also the city centre. This apartment offers a superb opportunity with a nicely presented interior giving a fresh homely appeal.\n\nThe accommodation briefly consists of an entrance hall with an intercom, hot press, storage cupboard and utility cupboard, a bright living/dining room with a door to the balcony, a fully equipped kitchen, two spacious double bedrooms (main en suite) with fitted wardrobes and a bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe apartment benefits from gas fired central heating, a South-West facing balcony and a designated underground car parking space.\n\nLocated close to Grand Canal Dock and Barrow Street this city location is among the most popular in Dublin and is further enhanced with the addition of the new development of Bolands Mills on Barrow Street. It is close to numerous eateries and sporting venues and within walking distance of the city. This apartment offers all the comforts of home coupled with every modern convenience and a great location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith intercom, hot press, storage cupboard and utility cupboard with Zanussi washer/dryer.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - \nwith windows and door to balcony.\n\nKitchen - \nwith range of fitted units, Whirlpool electric oven, Whirlpool electric hob, extractor fan, integrated Whirlpool fridge/freezer, integrated Zanussi dishwasher, tiled floor and stainless-steel sink.\n\nBedroom 1 - \ndouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes and window overlooking communal gardens.\n\nEn Suite - \nwith shower, wash hand basin, w.c., tiled floor and partly tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - \ndouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes and window overlooking communal gardens.\n\nBathroom - \nwith bath, wash hand basin, w.c., tiled floor and partly tiled walls.\n\nBalcony - \nSouth-West facing balcony overlooking communal gardens with storage cupboard with gas boiler.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>First floor apartment</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>South-West facing balcony </li><li>A designated underground car parking space</li><li>Unrivalled location</ul>"
      },
